STEP SYNTAX & RULES (in order within each job):
{% if analysis.azure_setup_task %}a. Set up the {{ analysis.primary_language }} runtime. Use task `{{ analysis.azure_setup_task }}`{% if analysis.runtime_version %} with inputs `{{ analysis.azure_version_key }}: '{{ analysis.runtime_version }}'`{% endif %}. Do NOT use echo commands for runtime setup.{% endif %}
